たらグラスやバラを連想させるような要素をさりげなく入れていただければと思います。\n・OC詳細（特徴）\n髪色：黒+紫インナー\n髪型：外ハネボブ\n目の色：ティファニーブルー\n性格：無口、ツンデレ\n\n使用用途：SNSアイコン、個人用グッズ\n\n金額に不足がある場合や内容が難しい場合は再送、もしくはキャンセルしていただいても大丈夫です！ \n是非ご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h-HzeAtjU2MwjCAvphRdlQeLo28ud-C-?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UpsideDownBody/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3833253, "client_id": 3655366, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97e4d9b103d6f3ef23a6725729e74f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97e4d9b103d6f3ef23a6725729e74f6, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c0a3723b7307320a9313365bb6f670f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ade260f53c3f405eb731af3f03113700 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f3a6132672eab2b5d98cf40509a725fa", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f3a6132672eab2b5d98cf40509a725fa, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1639b9e38828a51a5937386b784f84fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b82a2fc05865539f10e23ef06c62b9c4 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei! I would love to request a commission for 2 of my OCs.\n\n(1) Noah/190cm\n\nHe has a sleeve that is tied as if you hide the right arm (details shown in the concept image). He appears to have a cold personality, which stems from his traumatic experiences. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/118jb3GVZ_mbrstKwWa-Jk5fF_YyrSEqj\n\n(2) Valora/165cm\n\n She is a vampire huntress; she has a tomboyish and calm personality. You don’t have to include her sword.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/110k2yJBFHCuyXvHRoSUfceqgJoyqPOTZ\n\nTheir relationship is vampire and vampire huntress! They hate each other quite a bit. I have no mood required for this request, either a romantic or a creepy vibe, both are OK with me!\nAs for other elements, such as compositions, poses, etc., I will leave it entirely up to you! \n\nBoth of them have other outfits in the folder 'Variations'\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UpsideDownBody/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e031aad9/uploads/origins/c6e89a04-778e-40db-a45a-3b2c4c858e3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be8ae2b09e5898184a15be4f063ee825", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e031aad9/uploads/origins/c6e89a04-778e-40db-a45a-3b2c4c858e3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be8ae2b09e5898184a15be4f063ee825, h